# These JSON records bind one another by raw-byte SHA256.
# Preserve the actually validated bytes; do not rewrite scientific records
# solely because a checkout uses a different platform's line endings.
# Recognize CR as the saved line terminator, retaining all ordinary whitespace
# checks (blank lines at EOF, trailing blanks, and spaces before tabs).
*.json -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
